% Habits: consistency, Anki, to-do adherence.
\p{Yeah I take creatine guys\sidenote{[and you should too](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40395689/).}. Outside of that, I am a bit of a bum. I reduced my stretch routine to a mere 23min and that actually has allowed me to pick my consistency back up. Leetcode is a more of an active choice than laziness. I have grown bearish on the value of the exercise and if I want to throw my name in the DSA rat race. I think my time is better spent on anything [TPU](NZZ7) or [GPU](82U4) related.}
\p{In addition to my general computer science cards, I have begun to [make a deck](TAAK) for the [scaling book](scaling-book). This is the first time I have been actively reviewing cards as I progress through a book, and it makes \strong{a world of a difference}. Will definitely be doing this for the next book.}
